#: default.py
msgctxt "#32057"
msgid "1) Shortcuts\nCreate or edit userdata/keymaps/keyboard.xml and bind these two commands:\nRecord a marker: RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=record_skip_point)\nDelete a marker: RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=delete_skip_point)\n\n2) Recording rules\nWithin the first 20% of playback, the record key sets the intro end point.\nWithin the last 20%, it sets the credits length, counted back from the end, so episodes of different length still work.\n\n3) Season and per-episode markers\nThe first record of a season becomes the season marker. After that, recording a single episode only affects that episode.\nThe delete key only removes the current episode's marker; it never clears the season marker.\n\n4) Emby markers\nWith 'Use Emby markers' enabled, episodes already marked in Emby need no manual recording.\nPriority: per-episode marker > Emby marker > season marker."
msgstr "1) 绑定快捷键\n在 userdata/keymaps/ 下新建或编辑 keyboard.xml，把下面两条命令绑到按键上：\n记录标记：RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=record_skip_point)\n删除标记：RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=delete_skip_point)\n\n2) 记录规则\n播放进度在前 20% 时按记录键：记录片头结束点，之后播放自动跳到这里。\n播放进度在后 20% 时按记录键：记录片尾时长（从结尾往前算），片长不同的集也能用。\n\n3) 整季标记与单集标记\n某季第一次记录会作为整季标记。之后单独记录某一集，只影响那一集。\n删除键只删本集的标记，不会清掉整季标记。\n\n4) Emby 标记\n开启「使用 Emby 标记」后，Emby 已标记片头片尾的剧集无需手动记录。\n优先级：本集标记 > Emby 标记 > 整季标记。"

